I had hoped to stir up some discussion about potential enhancements to
Nethack with my earlier posting on aerosol spray cans, but perhaps the
idea isn't as good as I thought it was.  (I didn't come up with it, but
I do think it's great.  As a quick recap, the new tools would be spraycans
of mace, insecticide, musk, grease and chill cloud.  I forgot to mention
chill cload in my earlier posting.)

An unfortunate problem in Nethack/Rogue/Moria is that bows are very
undervalued compared to "real life."  This is caused by two problems:
1) finite ammo, and 2) can only shoot in 8 directions.  Really we should
be able to shoot at anything we see.  (When I come up against I dragon
I don't think I would want to give it the some opportunity!)

I don't have any suggestions for fixing either of this problems directly,
but how about a couple of new artifacts: longbow of ______ and crossbow
of _________.  I'll let someone else give them aesthetic names.  The bows
would turn the arrows/bolts into magic missile, fire or lightning attacks.
(Personally I'd skip the magic missiles, and give us a longbow of fire
and a crossbow of lightning or somesuch).

What do you think?

